WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Open the live demo page with the bundled synthetic business report.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The HTML report lists each check, severity and affected row counts.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
The required business name field fails on all 200 synthetic rows.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Other configured checks pass on the same table.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
A second sample report covers the small CSV demo dataset.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
GeoJSON boundary checks appear in the local area report.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Benchmark precision bars come from frozen Vancouver snapshots.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Recall bars summarize injected defect detection in the benchmark.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
The workflow loads data, runs checks, then writes results and reports.
